        {"id": "big-hide-the-bear-seek-together", "note": "Found five times, once by a nose — nobody hid alone, nobody sought alone, and the finding belonged to everybody."},
        {"id": "big-cardboard-brick-wall-build", "note": "Built twice, and the second one knew more: a lean is information, a fall is data, and a rocked brick gets a second chance."},
